  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Industrial recovery programme for the Syrian Arab Republic (2026#2030)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A strategic framework supporting the Government of Syria#s 2025#2030 Industrial Reform Agenda to restore productive capacities, modernise enterprises, support circular and green industrial development, rehabilitate industrial infrastructure and zones, generate decent jobs for conflict-affected populations, and embed Industry 4.0. The programme is anchored in the 2030 Agenda (SDG 9) and fully aligned with the UN Strategic Framework for Syria 2022-2024 (extended to 2026) # in particular Pillar II (Sustainable Socio-Economic Recovery) and Pillar IV (People Resilience &lt;(&gt;&amp;&lt;)&gt; Institutional Responsiveness) # and applies the SDG LNOB, gender equality and environmental sustainability principles.</narrative>
  </description>
